WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.597
A limit order is more than a click.

00:00:03.817 --> 00:00:09.213
Order Steward brings Kuru spot trading on Monad into one clear flow:

00:00:09.433 --> 00:00:18.426
