00:00:18.646 --> 00:00:21.794
Place it. Follow it. Cancel with confidence.

00:00:22.014 --> 00:00:23.813
Your keys stay yours.

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:26.281
Order Steward: trade with follow-through.
